\ Fast reference checks for the 47 canonical month-name indices.
\ Three names: 47*46*45 = 97290 ordered distinct sequences.
\ The last three-name sequence is 47,46,45.
\ For 47 names the total is 47 factorial and exceeds sauce modulus M.

To check the month name sequence counts:
  Put 3 into the selected month count.
  Count all month name sequences.
  If the month name choice's total sequences is not "97290",
    put "Three distinct month names have the wrong count." into the check report; exit.
  Put 47 into the selected month count.
  Count all month name sequences.
  If the month name choice's total sequences is not "258623241511168180642964355153611979969197632389120000000000",
    put "A complete 47-name permutation count was rounded or truncated." into the check report; exit.

To verify three month name indices given a number and another number and a third number:
  Put the chosen month names' first into the examined month name assignment.
  If the examined month name assignment is nil,
    put "The first month name is missing." into the check report; exit.
  If the examined month name assignment's name index is not the number,
    put "The first month name differs from the reference." into the check report; exit.
  Put the examined month name assignment's next into the examined month name assignment.
  If the examined month name assignment is nil,
    put "The second month name is missing." into the check report; exit.
  If the examined month name assignment's name index is not the other number,
    put "The second month name differs from the reference." into the check report; exit.
  Put the examined month name assignment's next into the examined month name assignment.
  If the examined month name assignment is nil,
    put "The third month name is missing." into the check report; exit.
  If the examined month name assignment's name index is not the third number,
    put "The third month name differs from the reference." into the check report; exit.
  If the examined month name assignment's next is not nil,
    put "A three-month name list has extra entries." into the check report; exit.

To check the month name lexical ranking:
  Put 3 into the selected month count.
  Put "1" into a month name rank wide quantity.
  Select month names from the month name rank wide quantity.
  If the month name choice's selection success is not 1,
    put "The first month-name sequence was rejected." into the check report; exit.
  Verify three month name indices given 1 and 2 and 3.
  Put "45" into the month name rank wide quantity.
  Select month names from the month name rank wide quantity.
  Verify three month name indices given 1 and 2 and 47.
  Put "46" into the month name rank wide quantity.
  Select month names from the month name rank wide quantity.
  Verify three month name indices given 1 and 3 and 2.
  Put "97290" into the month name rank wide quantity.
  Select month names from the month name rank wide quantity.
  Verify three month name indices given 47 and 46 and 45.
  Put "97291" into the month name rank wide quantity.
  Select month names from the month name rank wide quantity.
  If the month name choice's selection success is not 0,
    put "The month name chooser accepted an out-of-range rank." into the check report; exit.
